          "id": "1771484540640",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771484540641_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input Source:\n{{$context.$nodes.PICK_RELEASE_ALL.$output}}\n\nTask:\nEvaluate the value of {{$context.$nodes.PICK_RELEASE_ALL.$output.ReturnStatus}} and respond to the user accordingly.\n\nConditional Logic:\n1. If {{$context.$nodes.PICK_RELEASE_ALL.$output.ReturnStatus}} equals \"S\":\n   - Return a success message to the user:\n     \"Pick Release has been successfully submitted for the pending orders. Batch: {{$context.$nodes.PICK_RELEASE_ALL.$output.PickingBatchName}}.\"\n\n2. If {{$context.$nodes.PICK_RELEASE_ALL.$output.ReturnStatus}} equals \"E\":\n   - Return the error message exactly as provided in:\n     {{$context.$nodes.PICK_RELEASE_ALL.$output.ReturnMessage}}\n\nOutput Rules:\n- Return only one user-facing message\n- Do not add additional explanations or formatting\n- Do not infer or modify values\n- Use the values exactly as provided in the input source"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
