          "metadata": {
            "name": "DisplayShortageOrders"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DISPLAYSHORTAGEORDERS",
          "id": "1771485494935",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771485494936_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input Data Source (use only this):\n{{$context.$nodes.FORMATSHORTAGEDATA.$output.result}}\n\nPrecondition Check:\n- If the input list is null, undefined, or empty:\n  - Return a messageListWidget with a single message stating:\n    \"There are no delays due to shortage.\"\n  - Do NOT perform grouping, calculations, or add actions\n- Only proceed with the below logic if the input list contains at least one record\n\nTask:\nYou are given a list of shortage order records already grouped by Item and Order. Each record contains:\n- Item\n- Order\n- Qty (Total Requested Quantity)\n- UOM\n- DelayedDemandValue\n- LineCount\n\nYour task is to generate a directly renderable messageListWidget.\n\nOutput Rules:\n- Generate a one-line summary at the top describing the overall context (e.g., shortages and impacted orders)\n- One widget row per Item + Order combination\n- For each row:\n  - Use Item as the title\n  - Use Order as the subtitle\n  - Show Qty as Total Requested Quantity\n  - Show UOM\n  - Show DelayedDemandValue as Total Delayed Demand Value\n  - Show LineCount as Line Count\n- Do not include any extra fields\n- Do not show line-level details\n- Do not add any explanation beyond the one-line summary\n- Use only the provided input list\n- Do not infer or assume missing values\n\nProvide an action based on below Action Details:\n<oraInsight>\n{  \"title\": \"Pick Release Above Orders\", \n \"shortDescription\": \"Initiate pick release process for the Backordered orders.\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Pick Release Above Orders\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent({ \"command\": \"pickReleaseShortages\" })\"\n}\n</oraInsight>\n\nHard Constraints:\n- Use only the provided input list\n- Do not infer or assume missing values\n- Do not add commentary\n- Output must be a valid, directly renderable messageListWidget"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
