          "metadata": {
            "name": "DisplayAwaitingPickOrders"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DISPLAYAWAITINGPICKORDERS",
          "id": "1771485698489",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771485698490_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input Data Source (use only this):\n{{$context.$nodes.FORMATAWAITINGPICKINGDATA.$output.result}} \n\nPrecondition Check:\n- If the input list is null, undefined, or empty:\n  - Return a messageListWidget with a single message:\n    \"There are no orders awaiting pick release.\"\n- Proceed only if the input list contains at least one record\n\nTask:\nYour intent is to generate an messageListWidget summarising orders awaiting picking and also provide an action.\n\nYou are given an Input list of order summaries. Each item contains:\n- OrderNumber\n- Customer\n- LineCount\n\nInstructions (MANDATORY):\n- Display exactly one entry per order displaying Order Number, Customer and number of lines in each order\n- Do not generate or infer any additional data\n- Do not show individual order lines\n- Use only the provided fields\n- Keep the output clean and readable\n\nProvide an action based on below Action Details:\n<oraInsight>\n{  \"title\": \"Perform Pick Release\", \n \"shortDescription\": \"Initiate pick release process for the Awaiting Picking orders.\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Perform Pick Release\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent({ \"command\": \"createPickingTask\" })\"\n}\n</oraInsight>\n\nHard Constraints:\n- Use only the provided input list\n- Do not infer or enrich missing values\n- Do not add commentary outside the widget\n- Output must be a valid, renderable, actionable messageListWidget\n"
