        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Respond for picking tasks"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RESPOND_FOR_PICKING_TASKS",
          "id": "1771486009259",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771486009260_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Input Source:\n{{$context.$nodes.CREATEPICKINGTASKS.$output}}\n\nTask:\nEvaluate the value of {{$context.$nodes.CREATEPICKINGTASKS.$output.ReturnStatus}} and respond to the user accordingly.\n\nConditional Logic:\n1. If {{$context.$nodes.CREATEPICKINGTASKS.$output.ReturnStatus}} equals \"S\":\n   - Return a success message to the user:\n     \"Pick Release has been successfully submitted for the pending Picking orders with Batch: {{$context.$nodes.CREATEPICKINGTASKS.$output.PickingBatchName}}.\"\n\n2. If {{$context.$nodes.CREATEPICKINGTASKS.$output.ReturnStatus}} equals \"E\":\n   - Return the error message exactly as provided in:\n     {{$context.$nodes.CREATEPICKINGTASKS.$output.ReturnMessage}}\n\nOutput Rules:\n- Return only one user-facing message\n- Do not add additional explanations or formatting\n- Do not infer or modify values\n- Use the values exactly as provided in the input source"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Analyse User Query"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771490479273"
          },
          "code": "ANALYSE_USER_QUERY",
          "id": "1771490349547",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771490349548_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### INSTRUCTIONS\nYou are an intelligent query router for an Demand Advisor \n\n###Goal\nGiven the user's message, select the correct delegator workflow and route the request. \n--\n**Question:** {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n--\nClassification labels (must be exact)\nITEM_DEMAND\nORDER_QUERY\nEXPEDITE_ORDER\nORDER_STOCK\nand mapped to output QUERYTYPE\n\nITEM_DEMAND\nUse this when the user asks about the demand for a specific Item. If the Question contains the terms like Demand and Item use this.\n (e.g., What is the Demand for the Item INV-100 )\n\nORDER_QUERY\nUse this when the user asks about a specific order. If the Question contains the terms like Demand and Order use this. \n(e.g - What is the status of the order , Who is the customer for this Order , What are the Items in the Order).\n\nEXPEDITE_ORDER\nUse this when the user asks to expediate a Rush Order .\n(e.g - expedite the iPhone Order C7890)\n\nORDER_STOCK\nUse this when the user asks about stock availability for the Order\n(e.g - Is there stock for the Order C7890)"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"QUERYTYPE\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "QueryPath",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let hint = $context.$app.$OraMessageHint ?? $context.$triggers.REST.$input.intentOverride ;\nlet switcher = $context.$nodes.ANALYSE_USER_QUERY.$output.QUERYTYPE ;\n\nif (hint === \"Query\" && switcher ===\"ITEM_DEMAND\")\n  hint = \"ITEM_DEMAND\";\nif (hint === \"Query\" && ( switcher ===\"ORDER_QUERY\" || switcher ===\"PRIORITY_ORDER\" || switcher ===\"EXPEDITE_ORDER\" ||  switcher ===\"ORDER_STOCK\"))\n  hint = \"ORDER_QUERY\";\nreturn hint;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771490512802"
          },
          "code": "QUERYPATH",
          "id": "1771490479273",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Switch Query"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "ITEM_DEMAND": "1771490584220",
            "ORDER_QUERY": "1771492419910"
          },
          "code": "SWITCH_QUERY",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1771490512802",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771490512803_1",
              "name": "caseExpression",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.QUERYPATH.$output.result}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "SWITCH"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Item Number from User Query"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771490690226"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_ITEM_NUMBER_FROM_USER_QUERY",
          "id": "1771490584220",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771490584221_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an information extraction assistant.\nYour job is to extract ONLY the Item number from the User Input.\n\nReturn only the Item Number.\n\n-------------------\nEXAMPLES\n-------------------\n\nExample 1:\nTranscript: \"Find Demand for the Item INV-100\"\nOutput: INV-100\n\nExample 2:\nTranscript: \"Fetch pending Demand for the Item AS54888 \"\nOutput: AS54888\n\n-------------------\nNOW EXTRACT FROM THE USER INPUT BELOW\nTranscript: \"{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"ItemNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
