              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are generating an **Overview of Delayed Order Lines** UI.\n\nData:\n- Count of delayed order lines due to Item Shortage: {{$context.$nodes.GETBOLINES.$output.count}}\n- Item Shortage hasMore: {{$context.$nodes.GETBOLINES.$output.hasMore}}\n\n- Count of delayed order lines due to Pending Picking Task: {{$context.$nodes.GETAWAITINGPICKLINES.$output.count}}\n- Pending Picking hasMore: {{$context.$nodes.GETAWAITINGPICKLINES.$output.hasMore}}\n\n- Future High Value Order lines Processed via Trigger: {{$context.$nodes.READHIGHVALUEPROCESSEDORDERS.$output}}\n- Future High Priority Order lines Processed via Trigger: {{$context.$nodes.READFUTUREPRIORITYORDERS.$output}}\n\n- Future Orders Reserved via Trigger: {{$context.$nodes.READFUTURERSVORDERS.$output}}\n\n## Title\nDisplay the title exactly as:\n**Overview of Delayed Order Lines**\n\nProvide a short introductory sentence explaining that the overview shows delayed order lines due to Item Shortage and Pending Picking Task, and that users can click the actions to view detailed orders and potential actions.\n\n---\n\n## Delayed Order Lines due to Item Shortage\n\n- Display the heading exactly as:\n  **Delayed Order Lines due to Item Shortage (count)**\n- Display the count inside small braces.\n- Show a badge with message Level as Warning for this record as \"Shortage\"\n- Make this row actionable using:\n  `ora.Agent({\"command\":\"showShortageList\"})`\n- Provide a one-line summary mentioning the delayed order count. \n    - If `{{$context.$nodes.GETBOLINES.$output.hasMore}}` is **true**, mention that\n   there are more order lines, but only 25 order lines are shown here.\n    - If it is **false**, do not mention additional order lines or the number 25.\n\n---\n\n## Delayed Order Lines due to Pending Picking Task\n\n- Display the heading exactly as:\n  **Delayed Order Lines due to Pending Picking Task (count)**\n- Display the count inside small braces.\n- Show a badge with message Level as Info for this record as \"Awaiting Picking\"\n- Do not change the badge style or color.\n- Make this row actionable using:\n  `ora.Agent({\"command\":\"showAwaitingPickingList\"})`\n- Provide a one-line summary mentioning the delayed order count.\n      - If `{{$context.$nodes.GETAWAITINGPICKLINES.$output.hasMore}}` is **true**, mention that\n   there are more order lines, but only 25 order lines are shown here.\n  - If it is **false**, do not mention additional order lines or the number 25.\n\n---\n\n## System-Processed Priority Orders\n\nCheck whether either:\n- Future High Value Order lines Processed via Trigger, or\n- Future High Priority Order lines Processed via Trigger\n\ncontains one or more records.\n\nIf either contains records:\n- Display a section with the heading:\n  **System-Processed Priority Orders**\n- Provide one actionable summary stating that the trigger has processed future priority orders.\n- Make the row clickable using:\n  `ora.Agent({\"command\":\"viewTriggerActionData\"})`\n\nIf neither contains records:\n- Do not display this section.\n- Do not display any placeholder text.\n- Do not display any explanation.\n- Do not display any empty-state message.\n- Do not mention that this section is hidden or omitted.\n\n---\n\n## System-Reserved Future Orders\n\nCheck whether Future Orders Reserved via Trigger contains one or more records.\n\nIf records are present:\n- Display a section with the heading:\n  **System-Reserved Future Orders**\n- Provide one actionable summary stating that the trigger has reserved future orders.\n- Make the row clickable using:\n  `ora.Agent({\"command\":\"viewTriggerReservedData\"})`\n\nIf no records are present:\n- Do not display this section.\n- Do not display any placeholder text.\n- Do not display any explanation.\n- Do not display any empty-state message.\n- Do not mention that this section is hidden or omitted.\n\n---\n\n## General Instructions\n\n- Render only sections that are required by the available data.\n- Do not invent information.\n- Do not add any concluding remarks or wrap-up.\n- Do not explain why a section is missing.\n- Do not mention trigger-related sections if they have no records.\n- Mention \"25 order lines\" only when the corresponding `hasMore` value is **true**."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
