              "value": "Input : customerDelaySummary : {{$context.$nodes.SUMMARISEDELAYEDDEMAND.$output.result.customerDelaySummary}} \n\nYou are given an array named `customerDelaySummary`.\n\nInstructions:\n1. If `customerDelaySummary` is empty, respond exactly with:\n   \"No delayed orders found.\"\n2. Otherwise, generate a table and chart with the following columns:\n   - Customer\n   - Delayed Orders Count\n3. Use `SoldToCustomer` as the Customer value. If it is null, display \"Unknown\".\n4. Use `DelayedOrderCount` as the Delayed Orders Count.\n5. Display the rows in the order provided. Do not sort, filter, or modify the data.\n6. Do not perform any calculations.\n7. Do not add any commentary, analysis, or summary before or after the table."
            }
