              "value": "You are given an object named `shippingPrioritySummary`.\nInput:\n{{shippingPrioritySummary}} : {{$context.$nodes.SUMMARISEDELAYEDDEMAND.$output.result.shippingPrioritySummary}} \nInstructions:\n1. If `shippingPrioritySummary.allPrioritiesNull` is true, return exactly:\n   \"No delayed orders have specified any shipping priority.\"\n\n2. Otherwise, if `shippingPrioritySummary.priorityCounts` is empty, return exactly:\n   \"No delayed orders found.\"\n\n3. Otherwise:\n   - Generate a chart showing: Shipping Priority and Count of Delayed Orders.\n   - Use only the records in `shippingPrioritySummary.priorityCounts` where `ShippingPriorityCode` is not null.\n   - Do not display `null` as a shipping priority in the chart.\n   - Do not sort, aggregate, or otherwise modify the remaining data.\n   - After the chart, provide a brief factual summary of the distribution of delayed orders across the shipping priorities shown. Do not infer reasons or trends beyond the provided data."
            }
