              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given an email object with the following fields:\n\nsubject: {{$context.$triggers.EMAIL.$input.subject}}\nfromAddress: {{$context.$triggers.EMAIL.$input.fromAddress}}\ncontent: {{$context.$triggers.EMAIL.$input.content}}\n\nYour task is to generate ONE single valid JSON document with the following fields:\n- subject\n- fromAddress\n- content\n- Order\n\nRULES:\n\n1. Set the fields exactly as:\n   - subject = {{$context.$triggers.EMAIL.$input.subject}}\n   - fromAddress = {{$context.$triggers.EMAIL.$input.fromAddress}}\n   - content = {{$context.$triggers.EMAIL.$input.content}}\n\n2. Parse BOTH the subject and the content.\n\n3. IF:\n   - subject contains the word \"Priority\"\n   AND\n   - content contains ANY of the following:\n     \"Order\", \"Order#\", \"Order #\", \"Order Number\"\n\n   THEN:\n   - Extract the unique Order ID that appears immediately next to or after the order keyword.\n   - Set this extracted value as the Order field.\n\n4. IF the conditions are NOT met:\n   - Set Order = null\n\n5. Output ONLY a valid JSON object.\n6. Do NOT include explanations, comments, markdown, or extra text."
            }
          ],
