              "id": "1773394027654_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given a list of order line items in JSON:  \n`{{$context.$nodes.GETORDERDETAILS.$output.items}}`\n\n**Rules (must follow):**\n1. Use **only** the information present in the provided list. Do **not** infer, assume, or reference anything outside it.\n2. Output **exactly two bullet points** summarizing:\n   - The items (what they are, using the item identifiers/descriptions available in the list).\n   - The statuses of the order lines (include a compact breakdown such as counts per status, based only on the list. Use LineStatus not the LineStatusCode).\n3. Do **not** include any analysis, reasoning, headings, or extra text—only the final statements.\n4. After the two bullets, output the following JSON object only if at least one line has LineStatusCode equal to R or B. Otherwise, output nothing else.\n\n**Conditional action to output (only when applicable):**\n```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Pick Release\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"Initiate Pick Release for the Order.\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Perform Pick Release\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent({\\\"command\\\": \\\"pickReleasePriorityOrder\\\",\\\"agent\\\" : \\\"INV_WH_OPS_OUTBOUND_ADVISOR\\\",\\\"order\\\": \\\"{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_ORDER_NUMBER_FROM_USER_QUERY.$output.OrderNumber}}\\\"})\"\n}\n```\n\n---"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
