          "code": "DISPLAY_ACTIONS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1775200138915",
          "id": "1771483696744",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771483696745_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given the following input JSON array:\n{{$context.$nodes.PREPAREDATAFORACTIONS.$output.result.resultOrders}}\n\nEach element in the array has this structure:\n{\n  \"Order\": \"<OrderNumber>\",\n  \"Customer\": \"<CustomerName>\"\n}\n\nYour task is to generate actions based on this data.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\n1. Create a high priority action for each element in the input array.\n2. The action title MUST be exactly:\n   \"Priority Order email for <CustomerName>\"\n\n4. Each action MUST include:\n   - actionName: \"Process Order\"\n   Definitions:\n    suggestion = {\"Order\": \"<OrderNumber>\",\n  \"Organization\": {{$context.$variables.OrganizationId}} }\n   - command: ora.Agent({\"command\": \"processOrder\",suggestion: <suggestion>}) Parameters should be of json format.\nAll fields in ‹suggestion> should be present, even if null.\n5. The action description MUST:\n   - Clearly mention the Order Number <OrderNumber> from the input row of Array\n   - Be a complete sentence\n   - Indicate that this is a priority order requiring immediate attention\n\n6. Do NOT merge actions.\n7. Do NOT skip any records.\n8. Preserve the input order.\n\nDisplay a low priority action in the panel with title as \"Pick Release All\" and Add command for this action as - ora.Agent({\"command\": \"pickRelease\"})"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Read Vector for Actions"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775200402577"
          },
          "code": "READ_VECTOR_FOR_ACTIONS",
          "id": "1775200276789",
          "inputs": [
