              "id": "1775208875044_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given the following input JSON array:\n{{$context.$nodes.GETACTIONEDORDERS.$output.result}}\n\nEach element in the array has this structure:\n{\n  \"Order\": \"<OrderNumber>\",\n  \"Customer\": \"<CustomerName>\"\n}\n\nYour task is to generate actions based on this data.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\n1. Create a high priority action for each element in the input array.\n2. The action title MUST be exactly:\n   \"Priority Order email for <CustomerName>\"\n\n4. Each action MUST include:\n   - actionName: \"Order Status\"\n   Definitions:\n    suggestion = {\"Order\": \"<OrderNumber>\",\n  \"Organization\": {{$context.$variables.OrganizationId}} }\n   - command: ora.Agent({\"command\": \"viewDetails\",suggestion: <suggestion>}) Parameters should be of json format.\nAll fields in ‹suggestion> should be present, even if null.\n5. The action description MUST:\n   - Clearly mention the Order Number <OrderNumber> from the input row of Array\n   - Be a complete sentence\n   - Indicate that this is a priority order requiring immediate attention\n\n6. Do NOT merge actions.\n7. Do NOT skip any records.\n8. Preserve the input order.\n\n\n\nAfter above details, always render below low priority action with:\nAction Details:\n<oraInsight>\n{  \"title\": \"Pick Release All\", \n \"shortDescription\": \"This action triggers pick release for all eligible orders.\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Pick Release All\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent({ \"command\": \"pickRelease\" })\"\n}\n</oraInsight>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "GetOrderNumber",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "// Assuming the input is directly the suggestion JSON\nconst suggestion = $context.$nodes.RESOLVE_ACTION.$output.result.suggestion;\n\n// Initialize the fields you want to extract\nlet order = null;\nlet organization = null;\n\n// Check if the suggestion object is valid\nif (suggestion) {\n  // Extract the values from the suggestion object\n  order = suggestion.Order;\n  organization = suggestion.Organization;\n}\n\n// Create a new object with the extracted fields\nconst obj = {\n  Order: order,\n  Organization: organization\n};\n\n// Return the object containing Order and Organization\nreturn obj;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775209946363"
          },
          "code": "GETORDERNUMBER",
          "id": "1775209714499",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "OrderDetailsQuery",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "// Build the querystring dynamically\nconst orgId = $context.$variables.OrganizationId;\nconst order = $context.$nodes.GETORDERNUMBER.$output.result.Order;\n\nconst qs =\n  \"fields=Order,OrderTypeCode,LineStatus,SoldToCustomer,Item,RequestedQuantity,RequestedQuantityUOM\" +\n  \"&onlyData=true\" +\n  \"&q=OrganizationId=\" + orgId + \" and Order='\" + order + \"'\";\n\nreturn qs;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775210922212"
          },
          "code": "ORDERDETAILSQUERY",
          "id": "1775209755246",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "FetchOrderRowsDB",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "const order = $context.$nodes.GETORDERNUMBER.$output.result.Order;\nconst emails = $context.$nodes.READ_DB_FOR_CLEARING.$output; \n\n// Collect matching documentIdentifiers\nconst result = [];\n\n// Iterate through emails and find matching document identifiers\nfor (let j = 0; j < emails.length; j++) {\n  if (emails[j] && emails[j].text) {\n    try {\n      const textObject = JSON.parse(emails[j].text);\n\n      if (textObject.Order === order) {\n        result.push(emails[j].documentIdentifier);\n      }\n    } catch (error) {\n      // ignore invalid JSON\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775212473643"
          },
