              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given the following input JSON array: \nCommunications  {{$context.$nodes.GETORDERNUMBERSFORCOMMS.$output.result}} \n\nEach element in the array has this structure:\n{\n  \"Order\": \"<OrderNumber>\",\n  \"fromAddress\": \"<EmailAddress>\",\n  \"content\": \"<OriginalEmailContent>\"\n}\n\nyou have one more Filtered Orders Array - {{$context.$nodes.FILTER_ORDERS_FOR_CURRENT_ORGANIZATION.$output.result}} \nYour task is to generate communications based on this data.\n\nIf the Filtered Orders Array is null or empty do not return anything , if the array has data then follow below instructions\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\n1. Create a email communication for an Order in the Filtered Orders Array.\n2. **Email Title**: \n   - The title for the communication should be:\n     - \"Priority Order Handling for <OrderNumber>\n       (Use the **exact**Order as it appears in the input.)\n3. **Email Description**: \n   - The description should clearly mention the **Order Number**.\n   - It must be **complete and professional**.\n   - The description should state that the order is a **priority** order and requires **immediate attention**.\n\n4. **Email Body**: \n   - The body of the email must:\n     - Acknowledge receipt of the order.\n     - Mention the **Order Number** and **Customer** name.\n     - Confirm that the order is being processed as a **priority**.\n\n5. Preserve the input order."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
